Dear Admin, Welcome to Zoho Cliq! You've successfully created your Cliq organization, Looplayerdesign. We've put together a handbook to help you explore your admin powers and responsibilities. Download the handbook to get started! Download the Admin Handbook Here are few things you can do to kickstart your journey: Get your employees on board Go to the Admin Panel > General > Users and select Invite Users. Add your employees by email to invite them aboard. As the admin, you can view all the users in your organization and manage their permissions and profiles. Start collaborating Organize your workforce to collaborate efficiently using Cliq Teams. You can configure your team permissions and create team channels to enhance collaboration in your organization. Security always comes first Configure security by enabling TFA, setting your password policy, and defining allowed IP's and SAML authentication. Download the Admin Handbook To learn more about your capabilities as an Admin, download our admin handbook (attached). Links to remember Access Cliq Access Admin Panel @zohocliq zoho.com/cliq What’s New Help Guide Webinars Blogs Pricing Contact us Zoho Corporation:&nbsp; 4141 Hacienda Drive Pleasanton.CA 94588, USA This e-mail is generated from Zoho Cliq. If you think this is SPAM, please report to &nbsp; abuse@zohocorp.com for immediate action.

